      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دكّكهُ</span></b>  <i>He mixed it;</i> namely, colocynth
with dates or some other thing. (O, L, K.) You
say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَكِّكُوا لَنَا</span> <i>Mix ye for us.</i> (L, O.) [See
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُدَكَّكٌ</span>.]

